{"vid":"hIITRSyoLHw","source":"hIITRSyoLHw.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"what is welding inspection"},{"t":3.4,"txt":"welding inspection is a crucial aspect"},{"t":5.5,"txt":"of welding that ensures the quality and"},{"t":7.4,"txt":"safety of welded products it involves a"},{"t":10,"txt":"series of steps that are designed to"},{"t":11.5,"txt":"identify any defects or flaws in the"},{"t":13.7,"txt":"welding process which could compromise"},{"t":15.5,"txt":"the Integrity of the weld welding"},{"t":17.8,"txt":"inspection is essential for ensuring"},{"t":19.4,"txt":"that welded products meet the required"},{"t":21.2,"txt":"standards and specifications and it is"},{"t":23.4,"txt":"often a mandatory requirement in many"},{"t":25.3,"txt":"Industries"},{"t":26.8,"txt":"the process of welding inspection"},{"t":28.6,"txt":"involves three stages pre-welding"},{"t":30.6,"txt":"inspection and process welding"},{"t":32.2,"txt":"inspection and post welding inspection"},{"t":34.1,"txt":"each stage has its own unique set of"},{"t":36.7,"txt":"procedures and requirements which are"},{"t":38.5,"txt":"designed to ensure that the welding"},{"t":39.8,"txt":"process is carried out correctly and"},{"t":41.4,"txt":"that the final product meets the"},{"t":42.9,"txt":"required standards"},{"t":44.7,"txt":"in this comprehensive guide we will take"},{"t":46.9,"txt":"a closer look at each stage of welding"},{"t":48.7,"txt":"inspection including the procedures"},{"t":50.3,"txt":"involved the equipment used and the"},{"t":52.5,"txt":"standards and specifications that must"},{"t":54.4,"txt":"be met by the end of this guide you will"},{"t":56.9,"txt":"have a better understanding of the"},{"t":58.3,"txt":"importance of welding inspection and how"},{"t":59.9,"txt":"it can help to ensure the quality and"},{"t":61.6,"txt":"safety of welded products"},{"t":63.8,"txt":"2. pre-welding inspection stage"},{"t":68.4,"txt":"the pre-welding inspection stage is a"},{"t":70.6,"txt":"crucial part of the welding process this"},{"t":73.1,"txt":"stage involves checking the materials"},{"t":74.8,"txt":"and equipment to ensure they meet the"},{"t":76.3,"txt":"required standards for welding the"},{"t":78.6,"txt":"inspector will examine the materials to"},{"t":80.5,"txt":"make sure they are free from any defects"},{"t":82.3,"txt":"such as cracks or warping that could"},{"t":84.3,"txt":"compromise the Integrity of the weld"},{"t":86.9,"txt":"in addition the inspector will check the"},{"t":89.2,"txt":"welding equipment to ensure it is in"},{"t":90.8,"txt":"good working condition this includes"},{"t":93,"txt":"checking the welding machine cables and"},{"t":95.4,"txt":"other accessories the inspector will"},{"t":97.7,"txt":"also verify that the welding operator"},{"t":99.5,"txt":"has the necessary qualifications and"},{"t":101.5,"txt":"certifications to perform the job"},{"t":104.3,"txt":"during the pre-welding inspection stage"},{"t":106.3,"txt":"the inspector will review the welding"},{"t":108.1,"txt":"procedure specification WPS to ensure it"},{"t":111.2,"txt":"is appropriate for the materials being"},{"t":112.8,"txt":"welded the WPS outlines the specific"},{"t":115.8,"txt":"welding parameters such as the type of"},{"t":117.9,"txt":"welding process the welding position and"},{"t":120.2,"txt":"the welding technique that must be"},{"t":121.8,"txt":"followed to ensure a quality weld"},{"t":124.3,"txt":"overall the pre-welding inspection stage"},{"t":126.9,"txt":"is critical to ensuring that the welding"},{"t":128.7,"txt":"process starts off on the right foot by"},{"t":131.2,"txt":"identifying any potential issues before"},{"t":133.1,"txt":"welding Begins the inspector can help"},{"t":135.2,"txt":"prevent costly mistakes and ensure a"},{"t":137.2,"txt":"successful outcome"},{"t":139,"txt":"3. in process welding inspection stage"},{"t":144.1,"txt":"during the in-process welding inspection"},{"t":146,"txt":"stage the inspector monitors the welding"},{"t":148.4,"txt":"process to ensure that is being carried"},{"t":150.2,"txt":"out according to the established"},{"t":151.6,"txt":"procedures this stage is critical"},{"t":153.7,"txt":"because it helps to identify any defects"},{"t":155.9,"txt":"or issues that may arise during the"},{"t":157.6,"txt":"welding process and correct them before"},{"t":159.2,"txt":"they become major problems"},{"t":161.4,"txt":"the inspector checks the welds for"},{"t":163.4,"txt":"proper size shape and Alignment they"},{"t":166.3,"txt":"also examine the weld bead to ensure"},{"t":168.1,"txt":"that it is uniform and free of any"},{"t":169.7,"txt":"cracks porosity or other defects the"},{"t":172.8,"txt":"inspector may use various tools such as"},{"t":174.7,"txt":"gauges magnifying glasses and ultrasonic"},{"t":177.5,"txt":"testing equipment to check the quality"},{"t":179.2,"txt":"of the welds"},{"t":180.7,"txt":"in addition to examining the welds the"},{"t":183.1,"txt":"inspector also checks the welding"},{"t":184.6,"txt":"equipment to ensure that it is"},{"t":185.9,"txt":"functioning correctly they verify that"},{"t":188.4,"txt":"the welding machine is set up correctly"},{"t":190.1,"txt":"the electrodes are in good condition and"},{"t":192.2,"txt":"the shielding gas is Flowing properly"},{"t":194.8,"txt":"if any issues are identified during the"},{"t":197.2,"txt":"in process inspection the inspector will"},{"t":199.2,"txt":"work with the welding team to address"},{"t":200.5,"txt":"them immediately this may involve"},{"t":202.9,"txt":"adjusting the welding parameters"},{"t":204.4,"txt":"replacing faulty equipment or reworking"},{"t":206.8,"txt":"the welds"},{"t":208.2,"txt":"overall the in-process welding"},{"t":210.2,"txt":"inspection stage is crucial to ensuring"},{"t":212.2,"txt":"that the final product meets the"},{"t":213.7,"txt":"required quality standards by catching"},{"t":216.2,"txt":"and correcting any issues early on the"},{"t":218.2,"txt":"welding team can avoid costly rework and"},{"t":220.2,"txt":"ensure that the finished product is safe"},{"t":222,"txt":"and reliable"},{"t":223.6,"txt":"4. post welding inspection stage"},{"t":228.2,"txt":"after the welding process is complete"},{"t":230.3,"txt":"it's time for post welding inspection"},{"t":232.1,"txt":"this stage is crucial as it ensures that"},{"t":234.8,"txt":"the welded joint meets the required"},{"t":236.5,"txt":"standards and specifications the"},{"t":238.8,"txt":"post-welding inspection stage involves a"},{"t":240.9,"txt":"series of tests and examinations to"},{"t":242.7,"txt":"determine if the weld has any defects or"},{"t":244.6,"txt":"flaws that could compromise its"},{"t":246.2,"txt":"integrity"},{"t":247.4,"txt":"one of the most common methods used in"},{"t":249.5,"txt":"post-welding inspection is visual"},{"t":251.2,"txt":"inspection this involves examining the"},{"t":253.7,"txt":"weld with the naked eye to check for any"},{"t":255.4,"txt":"visible defects such as cracks porosity"},{"t":257.7,"txt":"undercutting or incomplete Fusion if any"},{"t":260.9,"txt":"defects are found they must be repaired"},{"t":263,"txt":"before the weld can be approved"},{"t":265.4,"txt":"another method used in post-welding"},{"t":267.5,"txt":"inspection is non-destructive testing"},{"t":269.2,"txt":"NDT NDT techniques include radiography"},{"t":272.8,"txt":"ultrasonic testing magnetic particle"},{"t":275.1,"txt":"testing and dipenetrant testing these"},{"t":277.9,"txt":"methods allow inspectors to detect"},{"t":279.5,"txt":"internal defects that may not be visible"},{"t":281.5,"txt":"during visual inspection"},{"t":283.7,"txt":"once the inspection is complete the"},{"t":285.8,"txt":"inspector will issue a report detailing"},{"t":287.7,"txt":"the results of the inspection if the"},{"t":289.9,"txt":"weld meets the required standards and"},{"t":291.6,"txt":"specifications it will be approved"},{"t":293.5,"txt":"however if any defects are found the"},{"t":296.3,"txt":"weld will need to be repaired and"},{"t":297.7,"txt":"reinspected before it can be approved"},{"t":300.4,"txt":"in conclusion the post-welding"},{"t":302.4,"txt":"inspection stage is critical in ensuring"},{"t":304.3,"txt":"that the welded joint meets the required"},{"t":306.1,"txt":"standards and specifications it involves"},{"t":308.8,"txt":"a series of tests and examinations to"},{"t":310.8,"txt":"detect any defects or flaws that could"},{"t":312.8,"txt":"compromise the Integrity of the weld by"},{"t":315.2,"txt":"conducting thorough post welding"},{"t":316.8,"txt":"inspections we can ensure that our"},{"t":318.5,"txt":"welded structures are safe and reliable"}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"what"},{"t":0.539,"w":"is"},{"t":0.719,"w":"welding"},{"t":1.079,"w":"inspection"},{"t":3.36,"w":"welding"},{"t":4.08,"w":"inspection"},{"t":4.44,"w":"is"},{"t":4.74,"w":"a"},{"t":4.92,"w":"crucial"},{"t":5.1,"w":"aspect"},{"t":5.52,"w":"of"},{"t":5.7,"w":"welding"},{"t":6.06,"w":"that"},{"t":6.24,"w":"ensures"},{"t":6.54,"w":"the"},{"t":6.839,"w":"quality"},{"t":7.2,"w":"and"},{"t":7.379,"w":"safety"},{"t":7.68,"w":"of"},{"t":7.859,"w":"welded"},{"t":8.22,"w":"products"},{"t":8.639,"w":"it"},{"t":9.48,"w":"involves"},{"t":9.84,"w":"a"},{"t":10.019,"w":"series"},{"t":10.2,"w":"of"},{"t":10.44,"w":"steps"},{"t":10.8,"w":"that"},{"t":10.92,"w":"are"},{"t":11.099,"w":"designed"},{"t":11.4,"w":"to"},{"t":11.519,"w":"identify"},{"t":12,"w":"any"},{"t":12.3,"w":"defects"},{"t":12.84,"w":"or"},{"t":12.96,"w":"flaws"},{"t":13.38,"w":"in"},{"t":13.559,"w":"the"},{"t":13.679,"w":"welding"},{"t":13.98,"w":"process"},{"t":14.34,"w":"which"},{"t":14.82,"w":"could"},{"t":15,"w":"compromise"},{"t":15.48,"w":"the"},{"t":15.719,"w":"Integrity"},{"t":16.139,"w":"of"},{"t":16.379,"w":"the"},{"t":16.5,"w":"weld"},{"t":16.859,"w":"welding"},{"t":17.76,"w":"inspection"},{"t":18.119,"w":"is"},{"t":18.48,"w":"essential"},{"t":18.84,"w":"for"},{"t":19.08,"w":"ensuring"},{"t":19.44,"w":"that"},{"t":19.68,"w":"welded"},{"t":20.039,"w":"products"},{"t":20.4,"w